# Shell scripts MUST check out with LF, on every platform. A CRLF line ending
# makes the Linux kernel/bash choke on the shebang exactly the way a UTF-8 BOM
# does ("bad interpreter" / "\r: command not found"), and deploy/seed-token.sh
# is on the documented one-command path a judge follows. Do not relax this.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for anything a container executes or parses at boot.
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.yaml text
*.yml text
